imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/6128/Location/52acb6ae26851b007ccf5293f1407121.webp)\n\nNew Launch  Luxury\n\n## Project Overview of Sheth Edmont Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\nProject Status\n\nNew Launch\n\nNo. of Units\n\n260 Units\n\nProject Area\n\n2.02 Acres\n\nTowers / Floors\n\n3 Towers / 51 Floors\n\nProperty View\n\nOpen View\n\nParking\n\nTwo Wheeler, Four Wheeler\n\n---\n\nNestled across 2.02 acres of prime land, Edmont stands as an epitome of sophistication, catering exclusively to the elite class. The residence boasts 51-storey skyscrapers housing elegant 2 and 3-bedroom, offering a panoramic view of the serene Manori Creek and lush green surroundings.  \n  \nEdmont is meticulously designed to provide an opulent lifestyle, marked by 25+ top-notch amenities that redefine luxury living. Beyond its architectural grandeur, Edmont ensures excellent connectivity, allowing residents easy access to the heart of the city. The project is strategically located in proximity to prominent shopping malls, theaters, schools, and hospitals, ensuring convenience in every aspect of daily life.  \n  \nWhether it's the allure of a luxurious home, the breathtaking views, or the seamless connectivity, Edmont stands as a testament to refined living, offering residents a harmonious blend of extravagance and convenience. This residential haven is more than just a dwelling; it's an exclusive retreat where indulgence meets urban sophistication. Invest in Edmont for a lifestyle that transcends the ordinary.\n\n## Floor Plans & Pricing of Sheth Edmont Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n![1 BHK Flat in Sheth Edmont in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 490979](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/6128/BHK_Configuration/971fa64e065212275b9151a9d02540bb.webp)\n\n1 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n646 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n1.9 Cr\n\n![2 BHK Flat in Sheth Edmont in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 490980](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/6128/BHK_Configuration/42151