.svg)\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n## Overview\n\nPresenting Ashwin Edmont Aurelia- a beautiful project, a well-planned living space which is the hallmark of thoughtfully laid out flats at reasonable prices. Ashwin Edmont Aurelia brings a lifestyle that befits royalty with its beautiful apartments at Kandivali. Your home will now serve as a perfect get-away after a tiring day at work, as Ashwin Edmont Aurelia will make you forget that you are living in the heart of the city. These residential apartments in Kandivali offer luxurious homes that amazingly escape the noise of the city center. In addition to that, there are a number of benefits of living in apartments with good locality. Ashwin Edmont Aurelia is conveniently located at Kandivali to provide unmatched connectivity from all the important landmarks and places of everyday utility such as various well-known hospitals, educational institutions, super-marts, parks, entertainment spots, recreational centers and so on.\n\n2 BHK, 3 BHK\n\nUnder construction\n\nPossession in Aug 2029\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹29,929/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n705 - 1133 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?\n\n* Convenient location.\n* Perfection is second nature.\n* Access to important landmarks.\n\n* Strategically Constructed Homes.\n* Intelligent home access control.\n\n## Google AI Summary\n\n✦\n\nReviewers frequently highlight the project as a premium landmark in Kandivali West due to its high-rise stature and luxury positioning. The developer, Ashwin Sheth Group, receives praise for maintaining high construction standards and providing detailed sample flats for transparency. The project is noted for its high-end lifestyle offerings, particularly the inclusion of private decks and walk-in wardrobes in larger units. Feedback indicates a strong focus on family-oriented living, with many users appreciating the proximity to schools, markets, and healthcare facilities. Some reviewers mention that while the project is upscale, the surrounding infrastructure is currently coping with high density and ongoing construction activities.\n\n![up-thumb](/assets/icons/up-thumb.svg)\n\n### The good things\n\nSpacious Layouts\n\nThe apartments offer generous carpet areas compared to typical compact configurations in the Mumbai market.\n\nPremium Amenities\n\nThe project includes over 25 lifestyle facilities such as a temperature-controlled swimming pool, a private theatre, and a fitness center.\n\nScenic Views\n\nHigher floors provide panoramic vistas of the Pagoda, Manori Creek, and Sanjay Gandhi National Park.\n\nStrategic Connectivity\n\nThe site is located close to the Dahanukarwadi Metro Station and major arteries like S.V. Road and Link Road.\n\nReputed Developer\n\nThe Ashwin Sheth Group has a documented track record of delivering quality residential and commercial projects.\n\nModern Features\n\nHomes are designed with French windows, spacious outdoor decks, and Vaastu-compliant internal planning.\n\n![down-thumb](/assets/icons/down-thumb.svg)\n\n### Needs improvement\n\nTraffic Congestion\n\nThe surrounding roads, particularly during peak hours, are prone to heavy traffic and bottlenecking.\n\nNoise Pollution\n\nThe lively atmosphere of the neighborhood and nearby construction leads to higher ambient noise levels.\n\nSpace Inefficiency\n\nSome layouts have excessive passage areas which lead to less optimized use of the internal carpet area.\n\nVisitor Parking\n\nThere is a perceived limitation regarding the availability of dedicated parking spaces for guests.\n\nHigh Density\n\nThe rapid increase in local residential projects is straining the existing local infrastructure and quality of life.\n\n---\n\nThe Verdict\n\nGreat for families\n\nPremium lifestyle choice\n\nStrong investment potential\n\nIdeal for high-floor lovers\n\nAvoid if traffic-sensitive\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/Aerobics-Room-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Aerobics-Room-secondary.svg)\n\nAerobics Room\n\n![amenities/cctv-secondary