](https://www.linkedin.com/company/blox-xyz/mycompany/)[![twitter-x-primary](/assets/icons/twitter-x-primary.svg)](https://twitter.com/blox_xyz)[![youtube-primary](/assets/icons/youtube-primary.svg)](https://www.youtube.com/@BloxPropTech)[![mail-primary](/assets/icons/mail-primary.svg)\n\nEmail us at:](mailto:hello@blox.xyz)\n\n---\n\nMumbai H/O\n\nRERA ID : A51900029429\n\nMethod & Madness Technology Pvt. Ltd., Unit No. 1202, 12th floor, One International Center, Tower-3, Senapati Bapat Marg, Mumbai, Maharashtra - 400013\n\nRERA ID : A51900029429\n\nOffice no 303, Platinum Square, Sakore Nagar, Viman Nagar, Pune, Maharashtra - 411014\n\nRERA ID : WBRERA/A/NOR/2026/000949\n\nOffice no : 7W84C, 7th Floor, West Block, Mani Casadona, Plot No. IIF/04, Action Area- IIF, Newtown, Kolkata, West Bengal - 700160\n\n---\n\n© Copyright 2026Blox.xyz","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/propertyview_ashwin-sheth-edmont-aurella-kandivali-west_7592.html","title":"Ashwin Sheth Edmont Aurella Kandivali West Mumbai - Price, Location, Possession, Reviews, Investor Flats, Resale Flats | PropertyCrow.com","raw_content":"![PropertyCrow.com](/propertycrow-logo-sm.svg)\n\n1. [New Projects](https://www.propertycrow.com/)\n›2. [New Projects in Mumbai](https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/property_residential-projects_1_1_0_0_0.html)\n›3. [New Projects in Kandivali West](https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/property_new-projects-in-kandivali-west_1_1_0_0_90.html)\n›4. [Ashwin Sheth Edmont Aurella](https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/propertyview_ashwin-sheth-edmont-aurella-kandivali-west_7592.html)\n\n![Ashwin Sheth Edmont Aurella](https://www.propertycrow.com//images/no-img-big.png)\n\n![Ashwin Sheth Edmont Aurella](https://www.propertycrow.com//images/no-img-big.png)\n\nby Ashwin Sheth Group\n\n# Ashwin Sheth Edmont Aurella\n\nTulaskar Wadi, Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\nConfig: 1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK Flats\n\nSize Carpet Area: 585 Sq.ft. - 1170 Sq.ft.\n\nPrice ₹On Request\n\nCall Now +917977640320\n\n**Code:** PropertyCrow7592\n\nPossession Status New Launch - Possession Around April 2029\n\nRERA P51800053546  \n[View RERA QR Code](#qr)\n\nUnits Available Investor / Resale Units Available\n\nAbout Project\n\n## ASHWIN SHETH EDMONT AURELLA\n\nAshwin Sheth Edmont Aurella by Ashwin Sheth Group stands as a landmark residential development in Kandivali West, one of Mumbai’s most well-connected and rapidly developing suburbs. With its towering structure that rises up to 51 floors, the project offers a blend of modern architecture, superior planning, and premium amenities, making it an\n\nideal choice for families looking to elevate their living experience in the heart of the city. Designed to create a balance between functionality and lifestyle, it caters to the needs of every generation with thoughtfully planned homes and an environment that fosters comfort and well-being.  \n  \nThe residences at Ashwin Sheth Edmont Aurella reflect meticulous detailing and an emphasis on quality. Each home is crafted to maximize natural light and ventilation while ensuring privacy and comfort. Whether you are a young professional, a growing family, or someone looking for a sophisticated retreat, the project offers a variety of configurations to suit your needs. The combination of intelligent layouts and a premium location ensures that this development is not just a home but a long-term investment in a refined lifestyle.  \n  \nResidents benefit from an array of amenities that are designed to enhance everyday living. With features like dedicated car parking, 24/7 water supply, CCTV surveillance, fire safety systems, and visitor parking, the project provides unmatched convenience and safety. The inclusion of wellness-focused amenities like a yoga and meditation area adds a dimension of holistic living, encouraging residents to rejuvenate amidst the busy pace of urban life. In addition, the landscaped surroundings, society office, and efficient water storage systems ensure seamless community living.  \n  \nStrategically located in Kandivali West, the project enjoys proximity to some of Mumbai’s finest social and lifestyle infrastructure. From reputed schools and healthcare institutions to shopping hubs, entertainment centers, and transport connectivity, everything is within easy reach. The location’s seamless connectivity to both Western Express Highway and Link Road ensures that residents are always well connected to other parts of the city.  \n  \nAshwin Sheth Edmont Aurella is not just another residential tower; it is a statement of luxury, comfort, and smart urban living. With its combination of excellent design, premium amenities, and a sought-after location, it represents the perfect blend of aspiration and convenience. For those looking to own a home in Mumbai that reflects sophistication while keeping them connected to the city’s pulse, this project offers an exceptional opportunity to embrace elevated living.  \n  \n**Configuration**  \n1 BHK Flats:  \nCarpet Area: 585 Sq.ft  \n  \n2 BHK Flats:  \nCarpet Area: 700 Sq.ft, 705 Sq.ft, 708 Sq.ft, 715 Sq.ft, 753 Sq.ft  \n  \n3 BHK Flats:  \nCarpet Area: 828 Sq.ft, 937 Sq.ft, 939 Sq.ft, 1133 Sq.ft, 1170 Sq.ft  \n  \nBuilding Details:  \n51 Residential Floors\n\nAmenities\n\n## Project Amenities\n\nLift  \nFire Fighting Systems  \nFeng Shui / Vaastu Compliant  \nWater Storage  \nCar Parking  \n24X7 Water Supply  \nVisitor Parking Facility  \nSociety Office  \nYoga and Meditation Area\n\nFloor Plans\n\n## Floor Plan\n\n![2 BHK Floor Plan](/floor-plan.jpg)\n\n🔒 Submit enquiry to unlock floor plan\n\nRERA Details\n\n## RERA QR Code\n\n![](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/7592/qrau_2876.png)\n\n**RERA No:** P51800053546\n\n**Developer:** Ashwin Sheth Group\n\n**Project:** Ashwin Sheth Edmont Aurella\n\n[Verify on MahaRERA Website →](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\nLocation\n\n## Location & Nearby\n\nMap - Tulaskar Wadi, Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n**Address:** Tula